 "Possible causes of the downturn: second-guessing a correct answer, drifting off the question, compounding small errors, or losing track of early context in very long chains.": "",
 "Whether and when accuracy falls with more thinking depends on model and task; some evaluations report it, others see plateaus. Hedged.": "",
